        <profile id="6795d908-5c32-599e-8223-60075274c760" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="7c8d488c-d228-4bea-8096-4c2f9e4527fe" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 2 · Starboard: 2 · Prow Ordnance: 2 · Dorsal: 2 · Defence: 4</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="13f03273-64ce-42dd-a8d3-bee982080b1b" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Every physical weapon, defence and hangar hardpoint must be filled exactly once. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="986998b5-a424-47dc-8b65-f3da092d2d9b" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 5 · Port 2 · Starboard 2 · Prow Ordnance 2 · Dorsal 2 · Defence 4. Fill every physical hardpoint exactly once; aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
